WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:05.687
A curriculum vitae organizes years into posts and publications. It

00:00:05.687 --> 00:00:10.824
rarely records uncertainty, strain or the cost of being constantly evaluated.

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:20.755
Finish the experiment, submit the draft, apply for the next award. A system

00:00:20.755 --> 00:00:25.126
can keep moving the point at which its members are allowed to rest.

00:00:30.008 --> 00:00:34.210
Good supervision offers criticism that improves the

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:38.412
science without confusing professional standards with personal humiliation.

00:00:43.133 --> 00:00:47.526
Academic work asks for persistence, but turning every sacrifice

00:00:47.526 --> 00:00:51.919
into a badge of commitment produces incentives worth examining.

00:00:56.758 --> 00:01:01.309
Scientific institutions should ask which parts of their incentives make

00:01:01.309 --> 00:01:05.860
research needlessly cruel, not only whether students can tolerate them.

00:01:10.842 --> 00:01:15.255
The essay asks how young researchers can pursue ambitious

00:01:15.255 --> 00:01:19.669
work without having their personal lives treated as disposable inputs.
